**Spec:** `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-04-22-entire-review-picker-install-awareness-design.md`

**Goal:** Replace the hardcoded, plugin-dependent curated-skills list in `entire review` with a three-source picker (built-ins + on-disk discovery + install hints) plus a runtime re-verification guard, eliminating the silent-failure vector where users pick uninstalled skills.

